		<Placemark id="42D28D051B423A11FC78">
			<name>LS-04 — Stream-channel debris flow</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<b>Class:</b> Drainage-gully / channelised 2026 failure<br/>
    <b>2026 feature:</b> Stream-channel debris flow<br/>
    <b>Interpretation:</b> Debris flow followed an established stream channel with tributary scars.<br/><br/>
    <b>Important:</b> This polygon is a conservative screening envelope derived from the published
    interpreter envelope extent. It is NOT the exact scar outline. Historical-image screenshots
    (2005, 2011, 2016, 2019, 2021, 2023) indicate pre-existing disturbed terrain, hollows and channels,
