	<Folder id="8323586899A423A11FC78">
		<name>Method / QA notes</name>
		<Placemark id="84847FE8A36423A11FC78">
			<name>READ ME — classification status</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<b>Purpose:</b> First-pass historical-landslide screening layer.<br/><b>Classes requested:</b> Old scar / Possible old scar / Reactivated 2026 / New 2026 / Drainage-gully only.<br/><b>Current limitation:</b> The historical Google Earth material supplied is perspective screenshots, not georeferenced orthophotos. Therefore exact Old scar / Reactivated / New polygon assignments are intentionally not fabricated. Features are marked Possible/Uncertain until historical imagery is georeferenced or digitised directly in Google Earth/QGIS.<br/><b>1997:</b> retain as reported historical episode only until an independent dated record is attached.<br/><b>Next QA:</b> digitise 2005 and 2023 scars at native coordinates; intersect with exact 2026 inventory; then promote classes with confidence levels.]]></description>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>98.1596,13.79993,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
	</Folder>
